
=== D=512 CEILING REPORT (50 iterations) ===
Date: 2026-03-20
Device: M1 Max (32 GPU cores, gen 13)
Best config: BD_HALF=32 BK=128 BQ=32 WM=4 (commit 8144da1)
Geomean: 0.80x SDPA (standard profiles B=2 H=8 N=1024-8192)
Peak: 0.94x at N=8192, 0.96x at N=32768 (asymptotic to 1.0x)
Improvement from baseline: 2.9x (0.27x → 0.80x)

Bottleneck: 16 D-split passes × ~4 barriers each = 64 barriers/K-tile
Cannot be reduced without:
  1. Separate K+V smem (drops to 1 TG/CU — net regression)
  2. Direct device reads (4x bandwidth penalty — 0.20x)
  3. Double-buffered K (drops to 1 TG/CU — net regression)
  4. Hardware async DMA (not available on M1-M4)
  5. M3+ L2 cache (untested on actual M3 hardware)

BK=128 is hard max for BD_HALF=32 (BlockLoaderT TCOLS=0 for BK>128)

